#{[17592186371679 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186371680 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371679 #edb/ref 1069 "q-123853" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371679 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371679 #edb/ref 1071 "Let $R=[5,6]\\times [1,3]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)$ be a function defined over $R.$\nThe lower and upper Riemann sums corresponding to an arbitrary partition $P$ of $R$ are given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(2{x}_{i-1}-3{y}_{j})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}, \\\\ U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(2{x}_{i}-3{y}_{j-1})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the definition of the double integral in terms of $L(f,P)$ and $U(f,P),$ compute ${∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A.$\n\n*Hint: You may wish to make use of the following result:*\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({x}_{i-1}+{x}_{i})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}=({x}_{m}^{2}-{x}_{0}^{2})({y}_{n}-{y}_{0})\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371679 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "eeafd037-077a-51ed-84eb-4b9e62434000" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371679 #edb/ref 1074 "For a function $f(x,y),$ the double integral of $f$ over a rectangular region $R$ is the unique number $I$ (if it exists) such that\n\n$$\nL(f,P)\\le I\\le U(f,P)\n$$\n\nover all partitions $P$ of $R.$\n\nFirst, notice that ${\\overset{¯}{x}}_{i}=\\frac{1}{2}({x}_{i-1}+{x}_{i})$ will always lie between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$, and similarly ${\\overset{¯}{y}}_{j}=\\frac{1}{2}({y}_{j-1}+{y}_{j})$ will always lie between ${y}_{j-1}$ and ${y}_{j}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n2{x}_{i-1}-3{y}_{j}\\le 2\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}({x}_{i-1}+{x}_{i})-3\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}({y}_{j-1}+{y}_{j})\\le 2{x}_{i}-3{y}_{j-1}\n$$\n\nwhich simplifies to\n\n$$\n2{x}_{i-1}-3{y}_{j}\\le ({x}_{i-1}+{x}_{i})-\\frac{3}{2}({y}_{j-1}+{y}_{j})\\le 2{x}_{i}-3{y}_{j-1}.\n$$\n\nMultiplying this by $Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}$ and applying the double summation gives:\n\n$$\nL(f,P)\\le {\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}[({x}_{i-1}+{x}_{i})-\\frac{3}{2}({y}_{j-1}+{y}_{j})]Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\le U(f,P)\n$$\n\nSeparating the sums using the addition and constant multiple rules, we get\n\n$$\nL(f,P)\\le {\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({x}_{i-1}+{x}_{i})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}-\\frac{3}{2}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({y}_{j-1}+{y}_{j})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\le U(f,P).\n$$\n\nUsing the hint, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({x}_{i-1}+{x}_{i})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j} & =({6}^{2}-{5}^{2})(3-1)=22 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({y}_{j-1}+{y}_{j})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j} & =\\frac{3}{2}({3}^{2}-{1}^{2})(6-5)=12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally then:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P)\\le 22-12\\le U(f,P)\\,⟹\\,L(f,P)\\le 10\\le U(f,P)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that \n\n$$\n{∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A=10.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371680 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371681 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371680 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371682 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371680 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371683 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371680 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371684 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371680 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371685 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371680 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371680 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371680 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186371682 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371680 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "7d7848e2-f768-55a9-aff3-ed72e02a83b6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371681 #edb/ref 1080 "12" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371681 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371681 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "dfe29d41-20aa-5404-b1fe-d53dd72a2e3f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371682 #edb/ref 1080 "10" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371682 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 1759218604549